{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:21Z","created_by_operation":"op_39ca9be173b947d08def668aa9941c13","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_1e152ffba5bb509b795e092acb487b38650fd2b97ff4f21caef35710d72c21d4","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"sahil87/run-kit@65653f4d91c5 snapshot fc34e1f500229b22","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_8903cf4c866995f7cb551c9826a48226e80e706f74833c776f0010b65ae45330","slc_b316a97be7253df78148eaa56413ad94e810bbace6309b86761c39eeaabc4665"],"source_ids":["src_9da569e1c935590ab1b7770237660edd"],"text":"`rk riff` requires being inside a tmux session (`$TMUX` set) and fails with \"not in a tmux session\" otherwise; agent state shows `—` until the hook setup runs and fresh agent sessions are started.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:21Z","updated_by_operation":"op_39ca9be173b947d08def668aa9941c13"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:21Z","created_by_operation":"op_39ca9be173b947d08def668aa9941c13","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_27e6c8fc29e55278d28f76e82b75d2911eee62f6bfd4f55e4ecd99c502c99983","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"sahil87/run-kit@65653f4d91c5 snapshot fc34e1f500229b22","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_6a3685200586aa09ee5ed25eb1678fbc11619fc9897b1897823b38c4dbd95d8b","slc_7b4f19ab88a8aaaadb235d9fac61b6849a80681107b64a05709e13d90213a898","slc_efe12c823e0bf6fd1eadfe04c79a511c12aecb4772d4cf5b0d7f56b84e6a4e81"],"source_ids":["src_661f330dbc4d588184d2aa83e609b2af"],"text":"A measured spike concluded the terminal relay mux must use per-stream bounded send queues with a non-FIFO scheduler: a shared FIFO made echo RTT 1.66s under flood at 1 Mbps, while per-stream queues held it to 32ms with no throughput cost.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:21Z","updated_by_operation":"op_39ca9be173b947d08def668aa9941c13"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:21Z","created_by_operation":"op_39ca9be173b947d08def668aa9941c13","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_38d90823ae2daa928ab01f58c12d659eae1864baa3de4cda9c02dfbd9c2b0abc","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"sahil87/run-kit@65653f4d91c5 snapshot fc34e1f500229b22","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_8bfc864fdcb61ece349ee999a5c71b225b37a8c744d1859554f5fe8e93f03c7a","slc_d68d27952c15fc0a4e0e480fe06a3511093218143464912b7efb8933a48a13a0"],"source_ids":["src_9da569e1c935590ab1b7770237660edd"],"text":"The product is deliberately agent-agnostic: it does not speak any agent's protocol or parse agent output, treating a pane as just a pane so the terminal layer survives agent-tooling churn.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:21Z","updated_by_operation":"op_39ca9be173b947d08def668aa9941c13"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:21Z","created_by_operation":"op_39ca9be173b947d08def668aa9941c13","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4306f314d8d92137c12642ee58d7d9a91625b2a285b827bebc7cf50c30591cc2","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"sahil87/run-kit@65653f4d91c5 snapshot fc34e1f500229b22","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_212d836a751988c07bc4d83653d1a10db14708f54f3bcbd04bd04ed589a050d4"],"source_ids":["src_9da569e1c935590ab1b7770237660edd"],"text":"`rk riff` supports repeatable `--skill`/`--cmd` flags (one pane each, in argv order), `--layout` (auto, tiled, even-*, main-*), presets in `fab/project/config.yaml`, `-N` parallel spawning with rollback on failure, and `--` passthrough of flags to `wt create`.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:21Z","updated_by_operation":"op_39ca9be173b947d08def668aa9941c13"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:21Z","created_by_operation":"op_39ca9be173b947d08def668aa9941c13","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_54efe180b906563606d715a65f05510f7ef6947b0309dff2f1708d7e2cb478eb","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"sahil87/run-kit@65653f4d91c5 snapshot fc34e1f500229b22","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_e32bda40a3866d663f88f021318c3f85078e2c2b048b11c15c96bd6aa849fdf1"],"source_ids":["src_9da569e1c935590ab1b7770237660edd"],"text":"The CLI includes an MCP server over stdio (`rk mcp`) as an allowlisted proxy over rk verbs, with `rk url --mcp` printing the `/mcp` endpoint, plus commands like `rk notify`, `rk cron`, `rk gui`, and `rk doctor`.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:21Z","updated_by_operation":"op_39ca9be173b947d08def668aa9941c13"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:21Z","created_by_operation":"op_39ca9be173b947d08def668aa9941c13","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6840d2f95ef77ee5d009b170de725c71ef657ddf0d8e4f5cf0de9509fb132772","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"sahil87/run-kit@65653f4d91c5 snapshot fc34e1f500229b22","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5189f779a3d32dd8353c12f513a1dcdc7af702ad6f73fdcb617070acf174d2bf","slc_8a73dde031e900a0bfa0c850cab59bae01001d3630a3a4a7b3128e6d202a6c9e","slc_d4adfbd1d1048fad05b612c0805284897345efb30b3d65a319e615624bdc8ee9"],"source_ids":["src_9da569e1c935590ab1b7770237660edd"],"text":"The product is two independent halves that compose: `rk riff`, which spawns agent workspaces (git worktree plus tmux window), and `rk serve`, which runs the browser dashboard watching tmux; either can run alone.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:21Z","updated_by_operation":"op_39ca9be173b947d08def668aa9941c13"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:21Z","created_by_operation":"op_39ca9be173b947d08def668aa9941c13","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_71f6b4b3cea2831e40c8a96e40dcd8cd9cf4b9b2f176a79a9f491e3aa9ce9643","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"sahil87/run-kit@65653f4d91c5 snapshot fc34e1f500229b22","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3b991864970e816f2d8748ae4352ec5b89b10ca81703a88d2268ece0b4710ec3","slc_732f8595b3ca454081f47f08fea8792812c673e6fc1def15af418d6a8d65ade7","slc_d2cb9a572a4ae9e223f7d69ff2ec60d0c59675b8ac84be359558e8faf2733e04","slc_d67ffcfd8a66ea6a11b3eca3616126df861d438292fc39f0fb371981cb274e6c"],"source_ids":["src_abd81943c9ed5e0eb1abd77ad89cfa5d"],"text":"Repository development practice: a post-mortem documents that a 59-file PR passed all gates (Go, tsc, ~3,590 vitest tests, two Playwright suites, build) yet needed ten review cycles against a budget of three, and recommends splitting changes by risk class and manually exercising new interaction components before ship.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:21Z","updated_by_operation":"op_39ca9be173b947d08def668aa9941c13"}
